Emblem vector: Wikimedia Commons, `Emblem of the United Nations (blue).svg`,
used as the source for `assets/emblem-badge.svg` and `assets/emblem-mono.svg`.

The flag vectors under `assets/flags/` come from the `flag-icons` package
(MIT license, https://github.com/lipis/flag-icons), one flag per United Nations
Member State (193) plus the United Nations flag. Flags are the symbols of
sovereign States; displaying a flag here is not a statement about any disputed
territory.

